### Login para obter o token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Listar contas
GET http://localhost:4000/api/getAllContas HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar conta por ID
GET http://localhost:4000/api/getContaByID/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inserir conta
POST http://localhost:4000/api/insertConta HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nome": "Conta movimento",
  "tipo": "corrente",
  "instituicao": "Banco Cooperativo",
  "saldoInicial": 1500.50
}

### Atualizar conta
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/updateConta/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nome": "Conta movimento principal",
  "tipo": "corrente",
  "instituicao": "Banco Cooperativo",
  "saldoInicial": 2000
}

### Remover conta (exclusão lógica)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/deleteConta/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
